# With no paste in 12 s after the stop, a Left Alt tap is a plain Alt tap.
# dictation AC-29.
0 in sock connect
0 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
500 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
350 out sock start 0
500 out sock stop 500
12600 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
12700 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
12700 out key KEY_LEFTALT down
12700 out key KEY_LEFTALT up
